  "description": "The composition of NCode.Coordination: providers registered on one builder and bound by primitive and keyspace, every requirement checked when the host starts, and every operation routed to its provider, traced and measured. Recipes over the primitives: locks, read-write locks, barriers, singletons, partition ownership, single-flight, rate limiters and cache invalidation.",
